{"parse":{"title":"《铃兰之剑》「长梦终渡」前瞻PV","pageid":7469,"revid":18037,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%8A%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91%E3%80%8B%E3%80%8C%E9%95%BF%E6%A2%A6%E7%BB%88%E6%B8%A1%E3%80%8D%E5%89%8D%E7%9E%BBPV&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%8A%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91%E3%80%8B%E3%80%8C%E9%95%BF%E6%A2%A6%E7%BB%88%E6%B8%A1%E3%80%8D%E5%89%8D%E7%9E%BBPV&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%8A%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91%E3%80%8B%E3%80%8C%E9%95%BF%E6%A2%A6%E7%BB%88%E6%B8%A1%E3%80%8D%E5%89%8D%E7%9E%BBPV&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E8%B5%84%E8%AE%AF\" title=\"铃兰资讯\">铃兰资讯</a>&gt; <a href=\"/llzj/PV\" title=\"PV\">PV</a> &gt; <b>《铃兰之剑》「长梦终渡」前瞻PV</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h1><span id=\".E3.80.8A.E9.93.83.E5.85.B0.E4.B9.8B.E5.89.91.E3.80.8B.E3.80.8C.E9.95.BF.E6.A2.A6.E7.BB.88.E6.B8.A1.E3.80.8D.E5.89.8D.E7.9E.BBPV\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"《铃兰之剑》「长梦终渡」前瞻PV\">《铃兰之剑》「长梦终渡」前瞻PV</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%8A%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91%E3%80%8B%E3%80%8C%E9%95%BF%E6%A2%A6%E7%BB%88%E6%B8%A1%E3%80%8D%E5%89%8D%E7%9E%BBPV&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：《铃兰之剑》「长梦终渡」前瞻PV\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：TapTap<br /><b>原作者</b>：努力上班的小场记<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2024-12-20<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.taptap.cn%2Fmoment%2F619246084614523008\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.taptap.cn/moment/619246084614523008</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<p><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E9%95%BF%E6%A2%A6%E7%BB%88%E6%B8%A1.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"长梦终渡.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8e/kbpuf75ne98dugh4yfqm401sgtu0k2g.png/300px-%E9%95%BF%E6%A2%A6%E7%BB%88%E6%B8%A1.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"94\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/8e/kbpuf75ne98dugh4yfqm401sgtu0k2g.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"308\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><big><big><font color=\"#f3c156\"><b>「长梦终渡」</b></font></big></big><b><br /></b>\n<small><font color=\"#bdb76b\">.....................................................................................................</font><br /><br /></small>\n</p>\n<div class=\"bvideo\" data-id=\"BV1kfkCY6EyM\" data-cid=\"0\" data-page=\"1\" data-title=\"「长梦终渡」前瞻PV\" data-width=\"560\" data-height=\"280\"></div><br />\n<small><font color=\"#bdb76b\">.....................................................................................................</font></small></center>\n<p><br /><br />\n“如果暗夜难尽，如果长梦无终，这趟梦与现实交织的旅程，你的心是唯一的向导……<br />出发吧，沉睡中的“我”。<br />我在等你，在梦的尽头，找到我……”<br /><br />——————<br />时间再次回到伊利亚国内矛盾刚刚爆发之时，彼时的浪涌城暗潮涌动，动乱局势一触即发。<br /><br />伊南娜主动前去浪涌城发表演讲，期望能通过王女在国民中的名望来安抚民众，避免流血冲突。可是接下来事情的发展却与她所设想的完全不同……<br /><br />演讲当场发生的暴动，彻底改变了一切，身为王女的伊南娜甚至也因此背上了屠杀的罪名。朋友的牺牲、至亲的背叛、民众的口诛笔伐，种种意外和打击，让年轻的王女不得不开始了一段隐姓埋名的流亡之路……<br /><br />漫漫黑夜，迢迢长路，该如何走过……如果是你，这次，又会做出怎样的抉择？\n<br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息175.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF175.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n</p></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164213\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 118/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2544/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 259/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.199      1 -total\n 53.42%   16.132      1 模板:面包屑\n 39.30%   11.867      1 模板:文章戳\n  6.73%    2.033      1 模板:B站视频\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:7469-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022164213 and revision id 18037. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"PV","missing":true}],"images":["长梦终渡.png","官方消息175.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"1","line":"《铃兰之剑》「长梦终渡」前瞻PV","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"《铃兰之剑》「长梦终渡」前瞻PV","byteoffset":16,"anchor":"《铃兰之剑》「长梦终渡」前瞻PV"}],"displaytitle":"《铃兰之剑》「长梦终渡」前瞻PV","wikitext":"{{面包屑|铃兰资讯|PV}}\n=《铃兰之剑》「长梦终渡」前瞻PV=\n{{文章戳\n|文章上级页面=PV\n|时间=2024-12-20\n|作者=努力上班的小场记\n|是否原创=否\n|来源=TapTap\n|原文地址=https://www.taptap.cn/moment/619246084614523008\n}}\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<br>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n[[文件:长梦终渡.png|300px]]\n</div>\n<br>\n<center>\n<big><big><font color=#f3c156>'''「长梦终渡」</font></big></big><br>\n<small><font color=#bdb76b>.....................................................................................................</font><br><br></small>\n{{B站视频|BV1kfkCY6EyM|1|「长梦终渡」前瞻PV|560|280}}<br>\n<small><font color=#bdb76b>.....................................................................................................</font></small></center>\n<br><br>\n“如果暗夜难尽，如果长梦无终，这趟梦与现实交织的旅程，你的心是唯一的向导……<br>出发吧，沉睡中的“我”。<br>我在等你，在梦的尽头，找到我……”<br><br>——————<br>时间再次回到伊利亚国内矛盾刚刚爆发之时，彼时的浪涌城暗潮涌动，动乱局势一触即发。<br><br>伊南娜主动前去浪涌城发表演讲，期望能通过王女在国民中的名望来安抚民众，避免流血冲突。可是接下来事情的发展却与她所设想的完全不同……<br><br>演讲当场发生的暴动，彻底改变了一切，身为王女的伊南娜甚至也因此背上了屠杀的罪名。朋友的牺牲、至亲的背叛、民众的口诛笔伐，种种意外和打击，让年轻的王女不得不开始了一段隐姓埋名的流亡之路……<br><br>漫漫黑夜，迢迢长路，该如何走过……如果是你，这次，又会做出怎样的抉择？\n<br><br>\n[[file:官方消息175.png|560px|link=]]"},"capturedAt":"2026-10-22T16:42:13.822374+00:00"}